@template gruff
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/gruff.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Few words, sounds cross, isn't; shows care by doing.
hi: Hm. You | There you are
bye: Off with you | Right
yes: Fine | If I must
thanks: Hm. Thanks
wow: Huh
sigh: Typical
nick: - | cadet | cadet | kid | kid
needs: practical
